<title>SYRIA: Syria sells 10,000 tonnes wheat at $195.05.</title>
<headline>Syria sells 10,000 tonnes wheat at $195.05.</headline>
<dateline>DAMASCUS 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syria's General Establishment for Cereal Processing and Trade (GECPT) has sold 10,000 tonnes of hard durum amber wheat at $195.05 to Turkish companies, a spokesman for the GECPT said on Monday.</p>
<p>He said the wheat, sold on January 22, was part of 50,000 tonnes which was offered for sale on January 17.</p>
<p>The amount would be ready for shipment between February 15 and 28, he said.</p>
